<title>UK: Turkey adds 150 mln marks to four-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Turkey adds 150 mln marks to four-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fungible bond was announced by lead manager Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TURKEY</p>
<p> AMT   *150 MLN DEM   COUPON     8.00	MATURITY    04.SEP.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.15    PAY DATE    19.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    100.80    YIELD	 7.76 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES     *ADD-ON TO 500 MLN DEM BOND LAUNCHED 13.AUG.</p>
<p> MOODY	BA3	 LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  B+	  DENOMS (K) 1-10</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  TURKEY</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.50 PCT BUND DUE AUGUST 2000</p>
<p> NOTES	FEES ON ORIGINAL DEAL TOTALLED 1.75 POINTS</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
